1
00:00:00,158 --> 00:00:05,911
Part 18 mein field sales: territories aur beats, salesmen aur unke target,

2
00:00:05,911 --> 00:00:12,441
chemists ko salesman se jodna, aur salesman ka field app jisme woh order aur payment

3
00:00:12,441 --> 00:00:14,074
collection karta hai.

4
00:00:15,033 --> 00:00:19,029
Masters mein Territories and salesmen kholiye.

5
00:00:19,029 --> 00:00:25,979
Territory ek area ya beat hai, jaise Ranchi Central, Ranchi North, Ranchi South,

6
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:30,149
aur Ramgarh-Hazaribagh, unke PIN codes ke saath.

7
00:00:30,821 --> 00:00:37,997
Salesmen ki list mein har salesman ka code, phone, territories aur monthly target hai.

8
00:00:37,997 --> 00:00:45,673
Ravi Kumar Ranchi Central dekhte hain, Suman Tirkey North aur South, aur Anil Mahto Ramgarh.

9
00:00:46,335 --> 00:00:51,550
Field app ke liye salesman ko uske login se jodna zaroori hai.

10
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:55,755
Ravi ka employee account Users mein ban chuka hai.

11
00:00:55,755 --> 00:01:01,643
Ravi ki row mein Edit dabaiye, User mein Ravi Kumar chuniye, aur save.

12
00:01:02,321 --> 00:01:06,823
Chemist profile mein territory aur salesman set hote hain.

13
00:01:06,823 --> 00:01:10,860
Isse har salesman ko sirf apne chemists dikhte hain,

14
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:15,517
aur unke orders aur collections uske naam se darj hote hain.

15
00:01:16,212 --> 00:01:17,759
Ab Ravi ka phone.

16
00:01:17,759 --> 00:01:21,672
Usne employee ID aur PIN se login kiya hai.

17
00:01:21,672 --> 00:01:28,315
Field app mein sirf uske chemists hain, har ek ka due, overdue aur phone,

18
00:01:28,315 --> 00:01:33,320
aur teen buttons: Book order, Call aur Collect payment.

19
00:01:34,005 --> 00:01:38,123
Morabadi Medicine Centre par Ravi order leta hai.

20
00:01:38,123 --> 00:01:42,577
Book order dabaiye, products jodiye, aur Place order.

21
00:01:42,577 --> 00:01:49,300
Order seedha office ki approval queue mein pahunchta hai, credit check ke saath.

22
00:01:49,300 --> 00:01:52,073
Koi kaagaz ya dobara typing nahi.

23
00:01:52,759 --> 00:01:55,472
Chemist ne 5,000 rupaye cash diye.

24
00:01:55,472 --> 00:02:01,694
Field app mein Collect payment kholiye, amount aur mode bhar kar Post receipt.

25
00:02:01,694 --> 00:02:08,715
Receipt Ravi ke naam se banti hai, aur Collections report mein salesman-wise dikhti hai.

26
00:02:09,425 --> 00:02:16,455
Recent orders mein Ravi apne orders ka status dekh sakta hai: approved hua, pick hua,

27
00:02:16,455 --> 00:02:18,192
invoice bana ya nahi.

28
00:02:18,192 --> 00:02:21,997
Chemist poochhe toh turant jawab de sakta hai.

29
00:02:22,694 --> 00:02:30,075
Owner ki taraf se MIS reports mein Salesman performance report hai: har salesman ki bikri,

30
00:02:30,075 --> 00:02:33,765
target ke saamne achievement aur collections.

31
00:02:33,765 --> 00:02:38,194
Sales by territory report area-wise bikri dikhata hai.

32
00:02:38,863 --> 00:02:44,305
Field app se salesman ka aadha din kaagaz aur phone mein nahi jaata.

33
00:02:44,305 --> 00:02:49,587
Order aur payment wahin darj, aur office ko sab turant dikhta hai.

34
00:02:51,250 --> 00:02:56,318
Part 19 mein chemist ordering portal: chemist ka registration,

35
00:02:56,318 --> 00:03:01,550
distributor se judne ki request, licence check ke baad approval,

36
00:03:01,550 --> 00:03:07,926
catalogue mein apne rates aur schemes, cart, order, status, invoices aur dues.

37
00:03:08,898 --> 00:03:13,922
Website ke anusaar chemist portal Professional plan se shamil hai,

38
00:03:13,922 --> 00:03:16,205
aur chemists ke liye muft hai.

39
00:03:16,205 --> 00:03:22,142
Pehle distributor ki settings dekhte hain: System mein Chemist portal kholiye.

40
00:03:22,808 --> 00:03:27,959
Yahan tay hota hai ki chemist kya dekhega: portal ordering on,

41
00:03:27,959 --> 00:03:35,186
distributor search mein naam dikhe ya nahi, stock exact packs mein, sirf In stock, Low,

42
00:03:35,186 --> 00:03:41,500
Out band mein, ya bilkul nahi, schemes, MRP, minimum order aur service area.

43
00:03:42,174 --> 00:03:43,986
Ab chemist ki taraf.

44
00:03:43,986 --> 00:03:52,047
Ek naya chemist, Ormanjhi Demo Medicals, portal par register karta hai: pharmacy ka naam,

45
00:03:52,047 --> 00:04:00,290
owner, mobile, email, state, address, PIN, aur dono drug licence numbers validity ke saath.

46
00:04:00,973 --> 00:04:05,787
Licence number Form 20B aur 21B, aur unki validity date.

47
00:04:05,787 --> 00:04:10,772
Password banaiye, terms accept kariye, aur Create account.

48
00:04:10,772 --> 00:04:18,251
Portal par account banne ke baad bhi koi distributor tab tak maal nahi deta jab tak woh

49
00:04:18,251 --> 00:04:21,345
licence check karke approve na kare.

50
00:04:22,032 --> 00:04:28,127
Find a distributor mein naam, area ya distributor code se dhoondhiye.

51
00:04:28,127 --> 00:04:34,134
MEDORO-RNC code daala, aur Medoro Demo Pharma Distributors mil gaya.

52
00:04:34,134 --> 00:04:36,165
Ask to connect dabaiye.

53
00:04:36,165 --> 00:04:40,052
KYC share karne ki anumati bhi isi mein hai.

54
00:04:40,731 --> 00:04:43,194
Wapas distributor ki screen.

55
00:04:43,194 --> 00:04:46,802
Chemist portal mein nayi request aa gayi.

56
00:04:46,802 --> 00:04:53,488
Licence numbers ki copy se milaiye, credit limit aur credit days tay kariye,

57
00:04:53,488 --> 00:04:57,007
ya kisi existing chemist se link kariye.

58
00:04:57,007 --> 00:04:58,151
Phir Approve.

59
00:05:00,965 --> 00:05:07,272
Ab chemist ke phone par My distributors mein distributor approved dikh raha hai.

60
00:05:07,272 --> 00:05:13,579
Order dabaate hi catalogue khulta hai: products, chemist ke apne rates, schemes,

61
00:05:13,579 --> 00:05:16,969
aur stock band, jaisa distributor ne chuna.

62
00:05:21,765 --> 00:05:24,152
Search mein Febrinil likhiye.

63
00:05:24,152 --> 00:05:27,526
10 plus 2 scheme yahan bhi dikh rahi hai.

64
00:05:27,526 --> 00:05:34,193
Quantity 20 likhte hi neeche Your order mein 4 packs free ke saath jud jaata hai.

65
00:05:51,420 --> 00:05:56,158
Neeche Your order mein products, approx total GST ke saath,

66
00:05:56,158 --> 00:06:00,736
aur ek note: rates aur schemes aapke distributor ke hain,

67
00:06:00,736 --> 00:06:05,554
stock aur credit distributor approval par confirm karta hai.

68
00:06:05,554 --> 00:06:07,160
Place order dabaiye.

69
00:06:07,890 --> 00:06:12,894
My orders mein order ka status hai: abhi Awaiting approval.

70
00:06:12,894 --> 00:06:19,086
Jaise hi distributor approve, pick, invoice karega, status yahan badlega.

71
00:06:19,086 --> 00:06:26,126
Dues and invoices mein chemist apna outstanding aur invoices dekhta hai, sirf apne.

72
00:06:26,848 --> 00:06:33,839
Distributor ki Orders screen par portal se aaya order source portal ke saath dikh raha hai.

73
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:37,526
Ise baaki orders ki tarah hi approve karte hain.

74
00:06:37,526 --> 00:06:42,981
Portal par password reset aur email verification abhi uplabdh nahi hai,

75
00:06:42,981 --> 00:06:45,132
yeh QA report mein darj hai.
